  "files": [
    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Virtual Pet</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"game-card\">\n    <h1>Pixel Pet</h1>\n    <div class=\"pet-container\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n      <div class=\"pet\" id=\"pet\">\n        <div class=\"pet-body\"></div>\n        <div class=\"pet-eye left\"></div>\n        <div class=\"pet-eye right\"></div>\n        <div class=\"pet-mouth\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"mood-text\" id=\"moodText\" aria-live=\"polite\">Your pet is feeling great!</p>\n    <div class=\"bars\">\n      <div class=\"bar-group\">\n        <label for=\"hungerBar\">Hunger</label>\n        <div class=\"bar\" id=\"hungerBar\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\" aria-valuenow=\"50\" aria-label=\"Hunger level\">\n          <div class=\"bar-fill\" id=\"hungerFill\"></div>\n        </div>\n        <span class=\"bar-value\" id=\"hungerValue\">50</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bar-group\">\n        <label for=\"happinessBar\">Happiness</label>\n        <div class=\"bar\" id=\"happinessBar\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\" aria-valuenow=\"50\" aria-label=\"Happiness level\">\n          <div class=\"bar-fill\" id=\"happinessFill\"></div>\n        </div>\n        <span class=\"bar-value\" id=\"happinessValue\">50</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bar-group\">\n        <label for=\"energyBar\">Energy</label>\n        <div class=\"bar\" id=\"energyBar\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\" aria-valuenow=\"50\" aria-label=\"Energy level\">\n          <div class=\"bar-fill\" id=\"energyFill\"></div>\n        </div>\n        <span class=\"bar-value\" id=\"energyValue\">50</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"controls\">\n      <button id=\"feedBtn\" aria-label=\"Feed your pet\">Feed</button>\n      <button id=\"playBtn\" aria-label=\"Play with your pet\">Play</button>\n      <button id=\"sleepBtn\" aria-label=\"Let your pet sleep\">Sleep</button>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": "Main HTML file with the pet, bars, and controls."
    },
    {
      "path": "style.css",
      "content": ":root {\n  --bg: #1e1e2f;\n  --card-bg: #2a2a40;\n  --text: #e0e0e0;\n  --accent: #f4a261;\n  --accent-hover: #e76f51;\n  --bar-bg: #3a3a50;\n  --hunger-color: #e76f51;\n  --happiness-color: #f4a261;\n  --energy-color: #2a9d8f;\n  --font: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;\n}\n\n* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nbody {\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  font-family: var(--font);\n  font-size: 16px;\n  color: var(--text);\n  padding: 16px;\n}\n\n.game-card {\n  background: var(--card-bg);\n  border-radius: 24px;\n  padding: 32px 24px;\n  max-width: 480px;\n  width: 100%;\n  box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 24px;\n}\n\nh1 {\n  font-size: 1.75rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  color: var(--accent);\n}\n\n.pet-container {\n  width: 160px;\n  height: 160px;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  background: var(--bar-bg);\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  padding: 16px;\n}\n\n.pet {\n  position: relative;\n  width: 100px;\n  height: 100px;\n  image-rendering: pixelated;\n}\n\n.pet-body {\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 100%;\n  background: var(--accent);\n  border-radius: 20% 20% 40% 40%;\n  box-shadow: inset -8px -8px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.15), 0 0 0 4px var(--card-bg);\n}\n\n.pet-eye {\n  position: absolute;\n  width: 16px;\n  height: 16px;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  top: 30px;\n}\n\n.pet-eye.left { left: 20px; }\n.pet-eye.right { right: 20px; }\n\n.pet-mouth {\n  position: absolute;\n  width: 24px;\n  height: 12px;\n  border-bottom: 4px solid var(--bg);\n  border-radius: 0 0 50% 50%;\n  bottom: 20px;\n  left: 50%;\n  transform: translateX(-50%);\n}\n\n.mood-text {\n  font-size: 1.125rem;\n  text-align: center;\n  min-height: 1.5em;\n  color: var(--text);\n}\n\n.bars {\n  width: 100%;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 12px;\n}\n\n.bar-group {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 12px;\n}\n\n.bar-group label {\n  width: 80px;\n  font-size: 0.9rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: var(--text);\n}\n\n.bar {\n  flex: 1;\n  height: 16px;\n  background: var(--bar-bg);\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n.bar-fill {\n  height: 100%;\n  width: 50%;\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  transition: width 0.3s ease;\n}\n\n#hungerFill { background: var(--hunger-color); }\n#happinessFill { background: var(--happiness-color); }\n#energyFill { background: var(--energy-color); }\n\n.bar-value {\n  width: 32px;\n  text-align: right;\n  font-size: 0.9rem;\n  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n}\n\n.controls {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 12px;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n  justify-content: center;\n}\n\nbutton {\n  font-family: var(--font);\n  font-size: 1rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  padding: 12px 24px;\n  border: none;\n  border-radius: 12px;\n  background: var(--accent);\n  color: var(--bg);\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: background 0.15s, transform 0.1s;\n  min-width: 80px;\n}\n\nbutton:hover {\n  background: var(--accent-hover);\n}\n\nbutton:focus-visible {\n  outline: 3px solid var(--text);\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n}\n\nbutton:active {\n  transform: scale(0.95);\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 400px) {\n  .game-card {\n    padding: 24px 16px;\n  }\n  .bar-group label {\n    width: 60px;\n    font-size: 0.8rem;\n  }\n  button {\n    padding: 10px 16px;\n    font-size: 0.9rem;\n  }\n}",
      "description": "CSS styling and pet drawing."
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "const state = {\n  hunger: 50,\n  happiness: 50,\n  energy: 50\n};\n\nconst moodText = document.getElementById('moodText');\nconst hungerFill = document.getElementById('hungerFill');\nconst happinessFill = document.getElementById('happinessFill');\nconst energyFill = document.getElementById('energyFill');\nconst hungerValue = document.getElementById('hungerValue');\nconst happinessValue = document.getElementById('happinessValue');\nconst energyValue = document.getElementById('energyValue');\nconst hungerBar = document.getElementById('hungerBar');\nconst happinessBar = document.getElementById('happinessBar');\nconst energyBar = document.getElementById('energyBar');\n\nfunction clamp(value) {\n  return Math.max(0, Math.min(100, value));\n}\n\nfunction updateUI() {\n  hungerFill.style.width = state.hunger + '%';\n  happinessFill.style.width = state.happiness + '%';\n  energyFill.style.width = state.energy + '%';\n  hungerValue.textContent = state.hunger;\n  happinessValue.textContent = state.happiness;\n  energyValue.textContent = state.energy;\n  hungerBar.setAttribute('aria-valuenow', state.hunger);\n  happinessBar.setAttribute('aria-valuenow', state.happiness);\n  energyBar.setAttribute('aria-valuenow', state.energy);\n\n  const avg = (state.hunger + state.happiness + state.energy) / 3;\n  if (avg >= 70) {\n    moodText.textContent = 'Your pet is feeling great!';\n  } else if (avg >= 40) {\n    moodText.textContent = 'Your pet is doing okay.';\n  } else if (avg >= 20) {\n    moodText.textContent = 'Your pet needs some attention.';\n  } else {\n    moodText.textContent = 'Your pet is not feeling well...';\n  }\n}\n\nfunction feed() {\n  state.hunger = clamp(state.hunger + 20);\n  state.energy = clamp(state.energy - 5);\n  state.happiness = clamp(state.happiness + 5);\n  updateUI();\n}\n\nfunction play() {\n  state.happiness = clamp(state.happiness + 15);\n  state.energy = clamp(state.energy - 15);\n  state.hunger = clamp(state.hunger - 10);\n  updateUI();\n}\n\nfunction sleep() {\n  state.energy = clamp(state.energy + 25);\n  state.hunger = clamp(state.hunger - 5);\n  state.happiness = clamp(state.happiness - 5);\n  updateUI();\n}\n\ndocument.getElementById('feedBtn').addEventListener('click', feed);\ndocument.getElementById('playBtn').addEventListener('click', play);\ndocument.getElementById('sleepBtn').addEventListener('click', sleep);\n\nupdateUI();",
      "description": "Game logic and event listeners."
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Virtual Pet\n\nA self-contained offline browser game where you care for a CSS-drawn pixel creature. Monitor its hunger, happiness, and energy bars, and use the Feed, Play, and Sleep buttons to keep it happy.\n\n## Features\n\n- CSS-drawn pixel pet with expressive mood text\n- Three stat bars: Hunger, Happiness, Energy\n- Feed, Play, and Sleep buttons that adjust stats\n- Mood text updates based on average stats\n- Fully keyboard accessible with visible focus states\n- Responsive design down to 360px\n- No external dependencies or network requests\n\n## How to Play\n\n1. Open `index.html` in any modern browser.\n2. Click or tap the buttons to interact with your pet:\n   - **Feed**: Increases hunger, slightly decreases energy and increases happiness.\n   - **Play**: Increases happiness, decreases energy and hunger.\n   - **Sleep**: Increases energy, slightly decreases hunger and happiness.\n3. Watch the mood text change as your pet's stats fluctuate.\n\n## Controls\n\nAll buttons are focusable via Tab and can be activated with Enter or Space. The mood text uses `aria-live` to announce changes to screen readers.\n\n## Tech Stack\n\n- HTML5\n- CSS3 (custom properties, flexbox, transitions)\n- Vanilla JavaScript (no libraries)\n\n## File Structure\n\n- `index.html` – markup and structure\n- `style.css` – all styling and CSS pet drawing\n- `script.js` – game state and logic\n- `README.md` – this file\n\n## License\n\nMIT",
      "description": "Project documentation."
    }
  ]
}